---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { APP_STORE_URL, SUPPORT_EMAIL, pathFor } from '../../config/site';
---
<SiteLayout
  title="Support and contact"
  description="Golden Moments help for iPhone and iPad, email support, privacy and deletion requests, accessibility problems, and App Store purchases."
>
  <section class="interior-hero">
    <div class="reading-column">
      <p class="eyebrow">Golden Moments / We're here to help</p>
      <h1>Support</h1>
      <p class="interior-lede">Tell us what went wrong, or what could be easier. You don't need to know any technical terms.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="reading-column prose-page">
    <section class="support-contact" aria-labelledby="support-contact">
      <h2 id="support-contact">Email the publisher</h2>
      <p>Golden Moments is published by Cloudjet Solutions Pte. Ltd., Singapore. Our public support contact is:</p>
      <a class="button button-primary" href={'mailto:' + SUPPORT_EMAIL + '?subject=Golden%20Moments%20Support'}>Write to support <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <p><a href={'mailto:' + SUPPORT_EMAIL}>{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a></p>
      <p class="small-print">This opens your email app. There is no account, live-chat bot, or website upload form.</p>
    </section>
    <h2>What to include</h2>
    <p>Tell us whether you're on iPhone, iPad, or this website. Describe the screen, the action you tried, and what happened. If you know the app version, include it. A short description is enough to start.</p>
    <p><strong>Please do not email personal family photographs, medical records, diagnoses, passwords, or payment card details.</strong> We will ask only for further details if needed.</p>

    <h2>Simple troubleshooting</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>If the screen seems stuck, use Back or close and reopen the app.</li>
      <li>Check the <a href={APP_STORE_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">current App Store listing</a> for device requirements and available updates.</li>
      <li>If choosing a photo fails (in a version with that feature), try one smaller picture and check available storage.</li>
      <li>If you still need help, email us with the steps above.</li>
    </ol>
    <p><strong>Avoid deleting or reinstalling the app as a first troubleshooting step:</strong> that could remove local photos, game settings, or other data you want to keep. <strong>Offload App</strong> may preserve data and is not the same as deletion.</p>

    <h2>Privacy requests and deleting photo copies</h2>
    <p>For step-by-step information about removing app-owned pictures, see <a href={pathFor('/privacy-choices/')}>Privacy choices and deletion</a>. If you want access to or deletion of information you sent us by email, write to <a href={'mailto:' + SUPPORT_EMAIL + '?subject=Golden%20Moments%20privacy%20request'}>{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a>. We cannot access or delete a picture stored only on your personal device.</p>
    <p>Read the <a href={pathFor('/app-privacy/')}>mobile app privacy policy</a> for the app's data handling, or the separate <a href={pathFor('/privacy/')}>website privacy notice</a> for this website.</p>

    <h2>Accessibility or unwanted content</h2>
    <p>If a button is hard to reach, text is difficult to read, a screen reader behaves unexpectedly, or an image is upsetting or may infringe someone's rights, let us know. Please identify the activity or screen rather than sending private family pictures. You can also read our <a href={pathFor('/accessibility/')}>accessibility note</a> and <a href={pathFor('/safety/')}>safety guidance</a>.</p>

    <h2>App Store billing and refunds</h2>
    <p>The website does not take payments. If an App Store purchase applies to the version you use, Apple manages the transaction. For eligible refund requests or purchase problems, visit <a href="https://reportaproblem.apple.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apple's purchase support</a>. This does not replace any refund rights you have under applicable law.</p>

    <h2>Current and upcoming features</h2>
    <p>The version currently published in the App Store may differ from development screenshots or code. Family-photo importing is being prepared for an update and is <strong>not available in the currently published App Store version</strong> as of October 18, 2026. This website does not upload or synchronize family photographs.</p>
    <p class="back-home"><a class="text-link" href={pathFor('/legal/')}>← All legal information</a></p>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
